        "TileImage": "$($repository b19493bb-e13f-4e2a-b591-e2f41d5f3f51).Image",
        "Description": "Don&apos;t cry, 47. These 3 targets have planned an act of terrorism, and if we dont act today, many will die.  Your targets will enfuse a nearby milk treatment facility with a deadly neurotoxin, killing millions. Also, 47, please stop stealing clothes. Your outfits are provided by the ICA and have our insignia. Leaving evidence is idiotic, 47. MISSION STATUS: ACTIVE",
